  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:us-epa-745')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T01:17:09Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-40/section-745.82', '84b5cc33b9d91b58e24947c90202c3a26f192e946fab93c5175726c2a09f4363', '§ 745.82 Applicability. (a) This subpart applies to all renovations performed for compensation in target housing and child-occupied facilities, except for the following:
