(b) Except as provided in subpart G of this part, a person is qualified to drive a motor vehicle if he/she—
(1) Is at least 21 years old;
(2) Can read and speak the English language sufficie', null),
  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:mn-admin-1300')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T01:17:09Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://www.dli.mn.gov/business/codes-and-laws/2020-minnesota-state-building-codes', null, '"The 2020 Minnesota State Building Code is effective March 31, 2020" … "not enforceable by municipalities unless it is adopted by local ordinance"', null),
  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:mn-admin-1305')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T01:17:09Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://www.dli.mn.gov/business/codes-and-laws/2020-minnesota-state-building-codes', null, '"The 2020 Minnesota State Building Code is effective March 31, 2020" … "not enforceable by municipalities unless it is adopted by local ordinance"', null),
