  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:stateplan:OR:osha_construction')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T01:17:09Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-29/section-1952.2', '65c124b8150633348c2a06d4bb796b71d023156f8aa03dff3f25fc354e8f50bb', '§ 1952.2 Oregon. (a) The Oregon State plan received initial approval on December 28, 1972.
