  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:stateplan:WA:osha_construction')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T01:17:09Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-29/section-1952.4', 'f3655a103d41dad2c0684739ae7a4e79259e921096f8f8263a3738e9f1de497e', '§ 1952.4 Washington. (a) The Washington State plan received initial approval on January 26, 1973.
