  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:stateplan:VT:osha_construction')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T01:17:09Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-29/section-1952.14', 'f423b3c75ae85c7601ceb4fc56d07ccca4079bc912177120ea736c639a4195f0', '§ 1952.14 Vermont. (a) The Vermont State plan received initial approval on October 16, 1973.
