  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:stateplan:NM:osha_construction')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T01:17:09Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-29/section-1952.20', '0469256b6700e02f56bd9bd9bb0b37fd72bdc12f0b7409bf0540985de17edbe1', '§ 1952.20 New Mexico. (a) The New Mexico State plan received initial approval on December 10, 1975.
