  ('adoption', (md5('academykb:adoption:stateplan:VA:osha_construction')::uuid)::text, '2026-11-22T01:17:09Z'::timestamptz, 'official_text', 'verified', 'https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-29/section-1952.21', '8f2609f56383404c4493fad85834b0076beefdc154de51e6c071db0e17f688b8', '§ 1952.21 Virginia. (a) The Virginia State plan received initial approval on September 28, 1976.
